{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出烏波離\n所問經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右此三十五佛名并懺悔法，出《烏波離所問經》，能淨\n業障重罪，現生所求禪定解脫，及諸地位皆能滿足。\n五天竺國修行大乘人，常於六時禮懺不闕，功德廣\n多文煩不能盡錄，但依天竺所行者略記之，餘如本經\n所述也"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042020", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0042020", "type": "mod", "text": "一卷【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042021", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0042021", "type": "mod", "text": "（開府…廣智）三十三字【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042022", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0042022", "type": "mod", "text": "大【大】，唐大【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042023", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0042023", "type": "mod", "text": "不【大】，大廣智不【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043001", "type": "mod", "text": "稱【大】，稱揚【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043002", "type": "mod", "text": "等【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043003", "type": "mod", "text": "四【大】，僧物四【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043004", "type": "mod", "text": "（（右此…述））作大書【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043005", "type": "mod", "text": "天竺【大】，天竹【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0043006", "type": "mod", "text": "也【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042020", "type": "orig", "text": "〔一卷〕－【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042021", "type": "orig", "text": "〔開府…廣智〕三十三字－【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042022", "type": "orig", "text": "（唐）＋大【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042023", "type": "orig", "text": "（大廣智）＋不【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043001", "type": "orig", "text": "稱＋（揚）【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043002", "type": "orig", "text": "〔等〕－【三】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043003", "type": "orig", "text": "（僧物）＋四【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043004", "type": "orig", "text": "（（右此…述））作大書【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043005", "type": "orig", "text": "天竺＝天竹【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0043006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0043006", "type": "orig", "text": "〔也〕－【三】【宮】"}
